{"id":"12504c0a8e","t":"Chronicles of the Blood Demon","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/file_000000000d0081f480fb699f78c2dbd3-785x1024-1-193x278.webp","n":14,"l":14,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon"},"u":1795038226880,"desc":"بعد أن تحول البطل “موك يون” إلى مصاص دماء متعطش للدماء إثر لقاء مصيري، تُقتل شقيقته الحبيبة على يد مقاتل فاسد ينتمي إلى فصائل العدالة المزعومة. وبقلب يغمره الغضب ولا يدفعه سوى الانتقام، يتخلى عن إنسانيته السابقة ليعانق الظلال. متسلحاً بقدراته المميتة كمصاص دماء وقوته المستمدة من الدماء، ينطلق “موك يون” في حملة قاسية لا هوادة فيها لتدمير عالم الفنون القتالية (الموريم) المنافق قطعةً قطعة.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","فنتازيا","موريم"],"src":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/1/"},"2":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/2/"},"3":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/3/"},"4":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/4/"},"5":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/5/"},"6":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/6/"},"7":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/7/"},"8":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/8/"},"9":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/9/"},"10":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/10/"},"11":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/11/"},"12":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/12/"},"13":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/13/"},"14":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-blood-demon|/manga/chronicles-of-the-blood-demon/14/"}}}